ars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-16T15:47:31-07:00","id":1455047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1455042-i-just-realized#post1455042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The reason they decided not to do Aegis is probably cause they\u2019re doing that Cyclops Cave thing with They Came From! Although they are doing Aether even though they just did a Victorian Age Mage game... what do you guys think?</div> </div> </div> </div>The developers already responded to you about this. They haven\u2019t \u201cdecided not to do Aegis\u201d, it is just one of many ideas that may happen that hasn\u2019t been greenlit yet. It has never been scheduled to happen and the canceled or postponed, it was just one example of a potential future project.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-16T17:10:55-07:00","id":1455056,"title":"","content":"Penelope.<br /> <br /> In the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1451830-tc-aether\">TC Aether thread</a>, only one month ago, you said:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1451830-tc-aether?p=1452363#post1452363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> [Cyclops' Cave] is probably why they postponed Aegis.</div> </div> </div> </div>I replied:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1451830-tc-aether?p=1452364#post1452364\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*sigh*<br /> <br /> I keep hammering this in: \u00c6gis is on my list of things I want to do. There are a lot of things on that list. It's not a guaranteed product. It's not an approved product. There's no one working on it. There's no outline.<br /> <br /> \u00c6gis has <i>not </i>been &quot;postponed&quot; because it does not exist.<br /> <br /> I know people got excited about the idea of it, but that doesn't mean it's a real thing that's happening.</div> </div> </div> </div>And then you answered:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1451830-tc-aether?p=1452394#post1452394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thank you. Idk that.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is not something you &quot;just realized.&quot; This is something you &quot;realized&quot; a month ago. I corrected you about it at that time. And you saw that correction. This isn't a case of me saying something in a random thread and you happened to miss it. I quoted and replied directly to you, and then you quoted and replied directly to me.<br /> <br /> Bringing it up here again seems like less of a mistake and more like you're deliberately trying to spread misinformation, which is against the forum rules.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>So I am officially warning you.</b></span><br /> <br /> I'm locking this thread now. If I see you pulling this something like this again, there will be further sanctions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":4,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","user":"IanWatson","date":". 07-16-2021, 09:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby